  "instructions": [
    "heat olive oil in a large terracotta dish over medium heat.",
    "add chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "add minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "add bay leaves and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add lemon juice, white wine, and fish broth, stirring to combine.",
    "add cod fillets and simmer for 8-10 minutes, or until cooked through.",
    "stir in crumbled feta cheese, diced tomatoes, canned artichoke hearts, and pitted kalamata olives.",
    "season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "serve hot, garnished with fresh parsley or thyme, if desired."
  ],
